{"chunkType": "excerpt", "collectedBy": "claude-opus-5", "collectionSession": "a256c4a3-c196-4e01-aec4-0bcec7774e0a", "date": null, "fetchedAt": "2026-09-08T00:44:36Z", "id": "chunk_scenes-103_joseon_late_scenes_injo-fire", "lang": "ko", "locator": "「내용」", "pageSha256": "63275ba323d398c8c9432c55e7e5e7f9661dbc7eea58fb3e4b272f9b8065601a", "permalink": "https://encykorea.aks.ac.kr/Article/E0047030", "sourceId": "src-ek-injo-banjeong-e0047030", "sourceUrl": "https://encykorea.aks.ac.kr/Article/E0047030", "text": "창덕궁의 제전(諸殿)에 인화되어 모두 불탔다."}
{"chunkType": "excerpt", "collectedBy": "claude-opus-5", "collectionSession": "a256c4a3-c196-4e01-aec4-0bcec7774e0a", "date": null, "fetchedAt": "2026-09-08T00:44:36Z", "id": "chunk_scenes-103_joseon_late_scenes_injo-gwanghae", "lang": "ko", "locator": "「내용」", "pageSha256": "63275ba323d398c8c9432c55e7e5e7f9661dbc7eea58fb3e4b272f9b8065601a", "permalink": "https://encykorea.aks.ac.kr/Article/E0047030", "sourceId": "src-ek-injo-banjeong-e0047030", "sourceUrl": "https://encykorea.aks.ac.kr/Article/E0047030", "text": "광해군은 반군이 대궐에 들어간 뒤에야 피신하였다."}
